=== S2.2 停号 U90000000006 → 其登录 401；恢复 → 可登录 ===
### disable U90000000006
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/admin/users/U90000000006/status -H Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_MASKED> -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"enabled":false}
HTTP/1.1 204 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:31:34 GMT



### disabled login attempt
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/auth/login -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"username":"U90000000006","password":"<PW_MASKED>"}
HTTP/1.1 401 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 41
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:31:34 GMT

{"detail":"invalid username or password"}

### re-enable U90000000006
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/admin/users/U90000000006/status -H Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_MASKED> -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"enabled":true}
HTTP/1.1 204 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:31:34 GMT



### re-enabled login
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/auth/login -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"username":"U90000000006","password":"<PW_MASKED>"} -o /dev/null


